WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.600
Narrator: Here's what Saudi Civil Defense ask everyone to do.

00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.800
Narrator: Stay calm.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:16.500
Narrator: Go straight to the nearest safe place - inside a solid building, in an inner area, away from windows and glass.

00:00:16.700 --> 00:00:20.300
Narrator: Keep away from open areas, balconies and rooftops.

00:00:21.542 --> 00:00:27.942
Narrator: If you're outside, get into the nearest building, or shelter behind a solid wall.

00:00:28.142 --> 00:00:34.542
Narrator: Don't film, don't go to look, and don't go near anything that has fallen.

00:00:34.742 --> 00:00:39.742
Narrator: Follow official instructions, and stay where you are until the all-clear.

00:00:39.942 --> 00:00:45.842
Narrator: At the stadium, avoid crowds and rushing - move calmly with your marshal.
